{"seq":4,"slug":"fault-models","title":"故障模型与容错","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/fundamentals/fault-models","wordCount":1570,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"故障模型与容错\">故障模型与容错</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>分布式系统中的故障是不可避免的。网络会分区、节点会崩溃、磁盘会损坏，甚至节点可能因为软件 bug 或恶意攻击而表现出任意行为。故障模型为我们提供了分类和推理这些故障的理论框架，而容错策略则是在给定故障模型下保证系统正确性的工程方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>理解容错设计的前提，是先明确系统&quot;假设什么会坏&quot;，以下概念构成这套假设的骨架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>故障分类谱系</strong>：从崩溃-停止（最温和）、崩溃-恢复、遗漏、时序到拜占庭故障（最严重），严重程度递增而可检测性递减。</li>\n<li><strong>故障假设决定协议</strong>：崩溃故障只需 n ≥ 2f+1，拜占庭故障需要 n ≥ 3f+1，代价的差异直接来自模型假设的强弱。</li>\n<li><strong>故障检测器</strong>：心跳与超时是基础手段，其完备性（不漏报故障）与准确性（不误报）不可兼得，只能按需要取舍。</li>\n<li><strong>FLP 不可能性</strong>：异步系统中即使只有一个进程可能崩溃，也不存在既保证安全性又保证终止的确定性共识，这正是实际系统必须引入超时或随机化的原因。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些概念串起来就是一条主线：<strong>先确定故障模型，再据此选择节点规模与协议，最后用检测与恢复机制兜住不可避免的故障。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"故障分类体系\">故障分类体系</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[故障类型] --&gt; B[崩溃故障]&#10;  A --&gt; C[遗漏故障]&#10;  A --&gt; D[时序故障]&#10;  A --&gt; E[拜占庭故障]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[崩溃-停止]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[崩溃-恢复]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[发送遗漏]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[接收遗漏]\">graph TD\n  A[故障类型] --&gt; B[崩溃故障]\n  A --&gt; C[遗漏故障]\n  A --&gt; D[时序故障]\n  A --&gt; E[拜占庭故障]\n  B --&gt; B1[崩溃-停止]\n  B --&gt; B2[崩溃-恢复]\n  C --&gt; C1[发送遗漏]\n  C --&gt; C2[接收遗漏]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故障类型</th>\n<th>严重程度</th>\n<th>行为描述</th>\n<th>检测难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>崩溃-停止</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>节点停止工作，不再恢复</td>\n<td>容易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>崩溃-恢复</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>节点崩溃后可能恢复，丢失内存状态</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遗漏故障</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>节点丢失部分发送或接收的消息</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序故障</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>节点响应超出预期时间范围</td>\n<td>较难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拜占庭故障</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>节点可能表现出任意行为</td>\n<td>极难</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"崩溃故障模型\">崩溃故障模型</h2><h3 id=\"崩溃-停止-crash-stop\">崩溃-停止（Crash-Stop）</h3><p>节点一旦故障就永久停止，不会恢复，也不会发送错误消息。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant C as Client&#10;  participant N1 as Node 1&#10;  participant N2 as Node 2&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;N1: 请求&#10;  N1-&gt;&gt;N2: 转发&#10;  Note over N2: 崩溃 ✗&#10;  N1--xN2: 心跳超时&#10;  N1-&gt;&gt;C: 故障转移到其他节点\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant C as Client\n  participant N1 as Node 1\n  participant N2 as Node 2\n  C-&gt;&gt;N1: 请求\n  N1-&gt;&gt;N2: 转发\n  Note over N2: 崩溃 ✗\n  N1--xN2: 心跳超时\n  N1-&gt;&gt;C: 故障转移到其他节点</pre><h3 id=\"崩溃-恢复-crash-recovery\">崩溃-恢复（Crash-Recovery）</h3><p>节点崩溃后可以重启恢复，但内存中的状态会丢失，只能依赖持久化存储恢复。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方面</th>\n<th>崩溃-停止</th>\n<th>崩溃-恢复</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>恢复可能</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态保留</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>仅持久化部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>较高（需 WAL）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>理论分析</td>\n<td>实际生产系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class CrashRecoveryNode:&#10;    def __init__(self, wal_path: str):&#10;        self.wal = WriteAheadLog(wal_path)&#10;        self.state = self.wal.recover()&#10;&#10;    def process(self, operation):&#10;        self.wal.append(operation)&#10;        self.wal.fsync()&#10;        self.state.apply(operation)&#10;        return self.state.result()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrashRecoveryNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, wal_path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.wal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WriteAheadLog(wal_path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.wal.recover()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, operation):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.wal.append(operation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.wal.fsync()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.state.apply(operation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.state.result()</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"拜占庭故障模型\">拜占庭故障模型</h2><p>拜占庭故障由 Lamport 于 1982 年在&quot;拜占庭将军问题&quot;中提出。故障节点可能发送矛盾信息、伪造数据或以任何不可预测的方式行事。</p>\n<h3 id=\"拜占庭将军问题\">拜占庭将军问题</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  G[将军-发起命令] --&gt; L1[副官 1-忠诚]&#10;  G --&gt; L2[副官 2-叛徒]&#10;  G --&gt; L3[副官 3-忠诚]&#10;  L2 -.-&gt;|发送虚假消息| L1&#10;  L2 -.-&gt;|发送虚假消息| L3\">graph TD\n  G[将军-发起命令] --&gt; L1[副官 1-忠诚]\n  G --&gt; L2[副官 2-叛徒]\n  G --&gt; L3[副官 3-忠诚]\n  L2 -.-&gt;|发送虚假消息| L1\n  L2 -.-&gt;|发送虚假消息| L3</pre><h3 id=\"容错能力\">容错能力</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故障类型</th>\n<th>容忍 f 个故障所需最少节点数</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>崩溃故障</td>\n<td>2f + 1</td>\n<td>n ≥ 2f+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拜占庭故障</td>\n<td>3f + 1</td>\n<td>n ≥ 3f+1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"故障检测\">故障检测</h2><h3 id=\"心跳与超时机制\">心跳与超时机制</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant A as Node A&#10;  participant B as Node B&#10;  loop 每隔 Δ 时间&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;B: PING&#10;    B--&gt;&gt;A: PONG&#10;  end&#10;  A-&gt;&gt;B: PING&#10;  Note over A: 超时 T 内无响应&#10;  A-&gt;&gt;A: 判定 B 疑似故障\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant A as Node A\n  participant B as Node B\n  loop 每隔 Δ 时间\n    A-&gt;&gt;B: PING\n    B--&gt;&gt;A: PONG\n  end\n  A-&gt;&gt;B: PING\n  Note over A: 超时 T 内无响应\n  A-&gt;&gt;A: 判定 B 疑似故障</pre><h3 id=\"故障检测器分类\">故障检测器分类</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>完整性</th>\n<th>准确性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完美检测器 P</td>\n<td>强完整性</td>\n<td>强准确性</td>\n<td>同步系统可实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终完美 ◇P</td>\n<td>强完整性</td>\n<td>最终强准确性</td>\n<td>部分同步系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终弱 ◇W</td>\n<td>弱完整性</td>\n<td>最终弱准确性</td>\n<td>足以实现共识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"phi-accrual-故障检测器\">Phi Accrual 故障检测器</h3><p>基于概率的自适应故障检测，根据历史心跳间隔动态调整判定阈值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import math&#10;&#10;class PhiAccrualDetector:&#10;    def __init__(self, threshold=8.0, window_size=100):&#10;        self.threshold = threshold&#10;        self.intervals = []&#10;        self.window_size = window_size&#10;        self.last_heartbeat = None&#10;&#10;    def heartbeat(self, now):&#10;        if self.last_heartbeat is not None:&#10;            interval = now - self.last_heartbeat&#10;            self.intervals.append(interval)&#10;            if len(self.intervals) &gt; self.window_size:&#10;                self.intervals.pop(0)&#10;        self.last_heartbeat = now&#10;&#10;    def phi(self, now):&#10;        if not self.intervals:&#10;            return 0.0&#10;        elapsed = now - self.last_heartbeat&#10;        mean = sum(self.intervals) / len(self.intervals)&#10;        return elapsed / mean&#10;&#10;    def is_available(self, now):&#10;        return self.phi(now) &lt; self.threshold\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PhiAccrualDetector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, window_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.intervals </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.window_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_heartbeat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> heartbeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, now):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_heartbeat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            interval </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_heartbeat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.intervals.append(interval)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.intervals) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.window_size:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.intervals.pop(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_heartbeat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> phi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, now):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.intervals:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_heartbeat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mean </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.intervals) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.intervals)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> is_available</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, now):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.phi(now) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.threshold</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"容错策略\">容错策略</h2><h3 id=\"冗余与复制\">冗余与复制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主从复制</td>\n<td>一个主节点多个从节点</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>主节点单点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多数派写入</td>\n<td>写入 W 个、读取 R 个</td>\n<td>无单点</td>\n<td>延迟较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纠删码</td>\n<td>数据分片 + 校验块</td>\n<td>存储效率高</td>\n<td>计算开销大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"隔离与限流\">隔离与限流</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[请求] --&gt; B{熔断器状态}&#10;  B --&gt;|关闭| C[正常处理]&#10;  B --&gt;|打开| D[快速失败]&#10;  B --&gt;|半开| E[试探请求]&#10;  C --&gt;|失败率达阈值| F[切换为打开]&#10;  E --&gt;|成功| G[切换为关闭]&#10;  E --&gt;|失败| D\">graph LR\n  A[请求] --&gt; B{熔断器状态}\n  B --&gt;|关闭| C[正常处理]\n  B --&gt;|打开| D[快速失败]\n  B --&gt;|半开| E[试探请求]\n  C --&gt;|失败率达阈值| F[切换为打开]\n  E --&gt;|成功| G[切换为关闭]\n  E --&gt;|失败| D</pre><h3 id=\"幂等与重试\">幂等与重试</h3><p>分布式系统中的重试是基本容错手段，但必须配合幂等设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>重试策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定间隔重试</td>\n<td>每隔 N 秒重试一次</td>\n<td>简单临时故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数退避</td>\n<td>间隔指数增长</td>\n<td>网络抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数退避+抖动</td>\n<td>加入随机偏移</td>\n<td>防止惊群效应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"flp-不可能性定理\">FLP 不可能性定理</h2><p>Fischer、Lynch 和 Paterson 于 1985 年证明：在<strong>异步</strong>系统中，即使只有<strong>一个</strong>进程可能崩溃，也不存在确定性共识算法能保证终止。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异步模型</td>\n<td>消息传递没有时间上界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一个故障</td>\n<td>仅需一个进程可能崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>无法同时保证安全性和活性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际系统通过引入超时（部分同步假设）或随机化来绕过 FLP 限制。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际系统的容错设计\">实际系统的容错设计</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>故障模型</th>\n<th>容错机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ZooKeeper</td>\n<td>崩溃-恢复</td>\n<td>ZAB 协议 + 多数派</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>etcd</td>\n<td>崩溃-恢复</td>\n<td>Raft + WAL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bitcoin</td>\n<td>拜占庭</td>\n<td>PoW 工作量证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PBFT</td>\n<td>拜占庭</td>\n<td>三阶段投票，3f+1 节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cassandra</td>\n<td>崩溃-恢复</td>\n<td>提示移交 + 反熵修复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>明确系统的故障假设——崩溃故障和拜占庭故障的容错方案截然不同</li>\n<li>使用 WAL（预写日志）保证崩溃-恢复场景下的状态持久性</li>\n<li>故障检测宁可误报（false positive）也不要漏报（false negative）</li>\n<li>使用指数退避 + 抖动作为默认重试策略，避免惊群效应</li>\n<li>通过 Chaos Engineering（如 Netflix Chaos Monkey）主动注入故障验证系统韧性</li>\n<li>设计时区分可恢复故障和不可恢复故障，采用不同的处理路径</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>故障模型是容错设计的第一步——先明确系统假设哪一类故障，后续的节点规模、协议和恢复手段才有依据。崩溃类故障只需 2f+1 个节点，拜占庭故障则需要 3f+1，代价差异正来自假设的强弱。故障检测在完备性与准确性之间不可兼得，心跳、超时与 Phi Accrual 都是在这一点上做取舍；FLP 定理则说明纯异步系统无法兼顾安全与终止，实际系统靠部分同步假设或随机化绕开。落到工程上，WAL、多数派复制、幂等重试与混沌工程共同构成一条从检测到恢复的完整链路。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"故障模型与容错","id":"故障模型与容错"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"故障分类体系","id":"故障分类体系"},{"level":2,"text":"崩溃故障模型","id":"崩溃故障模型"},{"level":3,"text":"崩溃-停止（Crash-Stop）","id":"崩溃-停止-crash-stop"},{"level":3,"text":"崩溃-恢复（Crash-Recovery）","id":"崩溃-恢复-crash-recovery"},{"level":2,"text":"拜占庭故障模型","id":"拜占庭故障模型"},{"level":3,"text":"拜占庭将军问题","id":"拜占庭将军问题"},{"level":3,"text":"容错能力","id":"容错能力"},{"level":2,"text":"故障检测","id":"故障检测"},{"level":3,"text":"心跳与超时机制","id":"心跳与超时机制"},{"level":3,"text":"故障检测器分类","id":"故障检测器分类"},{"level":3,"text":"Phi Accrual 故障检测器","id":"phi-accrual-故障检测器"},{"level":2,"text":"容错策略","id":"容错策略"},{"level":3,"text":"冗余与复制","id":"冗余与复制"},{"level":3,"text":"隔离与限流","id":"隔离与限流"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等与重试","id":"幂等与重试"},{"level":2,"text":"FLP 不可能性定理","id":"flp-不可能性定理"},{"level":2,"text":"实际系统的容错设计","id":"实际系统的容错设计"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式时钟与排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/fundamentals/clocks-and-ordering"},"next":{"title":"Paxos 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/consensus-protocols/paxos"}}